<title>USA: Oil-Dri Q2 Jan 31 net up on lower costs.</title>
<headline>Oil-Dri Q2 Jan 31 net up on lower costs.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil-Dri Corp of America, reporting higher fiscal second quarter results, cited a cost-reduction program combined with improved sales of higher-margin products.</p>
<p>Oil-Dri makes sorbent products for several markets.</p>
<p>Its shares were up 5/8 at 16-5/8 in afternoon trading Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
